Marmon, and I founded in LA.

00:05:53.452 --> 00:05:57.523
But it's worth it because
I love that community.

00:05:58.891 --> 00:06:03.062
So I so long ago made peace
with, you give up to gain.

00:06:04.463 --> 00:06:06.432
You know, it's so funny.

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:08.133
People say, "No pain, no gain."

00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:10.336
And they always mean it
with regard to exercise.

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:12.237 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's true with
everything in life.

00:06:12.237 --> 00:06:14.073
You are learning it now.

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:15.975
And by the way, wait till
they get to be teenagers.

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:16.909
- Oh, no.

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:18.344
- Then you may end up neurotic.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:19.278
- Oh, really?

00:06:19.278 --> 00:06:21.380
- They may cause it. (laughs)

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.783
