00:06:24.851 --> 00:06:26.085
- [Dennis] No, you're not.

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:27.153
- And I usually,
and I don't worry,

00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:28.821
I generally don't worry about,

00:06:28.821 --> 00:06:30.289 align:start size:84% position:16%
I worry about the
future of the world.

00:06:30.289 --> 00:06:31.791 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Oh.
- You know?

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
