00:06:39.398 --> 00:06:40.899
I'm not worried about that much

00:06:40.899 --> 00:06:43.936
in my day-to-day
life, basically.

00:06:43.936 --> 00:06:45.171
Especially now I'm not.

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:46.806
But I worry about the
nature of the world,

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:47.673
where the country's heading.

00:06:47.673 --> 00:06:48.574
- Oh, no, no.

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:50.609
That is a legit worry.

00:06:50.609 --> 00:06:51.544
- Is it?

00:06:51.544 --> 00:06:53.579
You've got a couple years on me.

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:54.780
How do you, where do you put-

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:55.715
- Oh, it's not even a matter-

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:56.949
- Where do you put that in life?

00:06:56.949 --> 00:06:58.451
It's just with you
all the time, right?

00:06:58.451 --> 00:07:01.387
- This one is not a matter
of a couple of years on you.

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:03.923
This I knew at a very early age,

00:07:03.923 --> 00:07:08.594
the most cultured country in
the world built Auschwitz.

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:12.731
There's this old question,

00:07:12.731 --> 00:07:16.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
how did the people who
gave us Beethoven and Bach

00:07:16.468 --> 00:07:18.303
give us Auschwitz?

00:07:18.303 --> 00:07:21.173
And I always found, it's
an interesting question,

00:07:21.173 --> 00:07:23.275
but it's somewhat
of a non-sequitur.

00:07:23.275 --> 00:07:25.845 align:start size:81% position:19%
Why does having
Bach and Beethoven

00:07:25.845 --> 00:07:28.915 align:start size:84% position:16%
inoculate you against
becoming evil?

00:07:30.182 --> 00:07:34.253 align:start size:97% position:3%
The ease with which a
civilization can turn morally,

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:38.424
that's what Germany taught.

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:41.560 align:start size:88% position:13%
And I see that happening
in the United States.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.631
This I always believed
was the kindest country.

00:07:45.631 --> 00:07:47.533 align:start size:84% position:16%
I know it has
rotten people in it,

00:07:47.533 --> 00:07:50.335
just as rotten countries
have kind people in it.

00:07:50.335 --> 00:07:55.408
But as a country, when people
wanted help after earthquakes,

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:58.711
they didn't ask for Belgium.

00:07:58.711 --> 00:08:02.881
When people used a flag
to rebel for liberty,

00:08:02.881 --> 00:08:06.151 align:start size:97% position:3%
