00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:09.989
- But look what's happening.

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:13.159
- Do you think that
it maybe is just

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.127
exactly what was going to happen

00:08:15.127 --> 00:08:17.396
